stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg px-3 py-3 -mx-3 transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.04] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-coral focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-zinc-950" href="/docs/faq"><span><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200 group-hover:text-white">Read frequently asked questions</span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Find answers about setup and product behavior.</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-brand-coral"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg px-3 py-3 -mx-3 transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.04] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-coral focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-zinc-950" href="/docs/releaseops/readiness"><span><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200 group-hover:text-white">Understand release readiness</span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">Check readiness signals and their limitations.</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-brand-coral"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></li></ul></section></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] p-4 my-5"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-4 w-4 text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"></path></svg><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">When an outcome is unknown</p><div class="text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed [&amp;_a]:text-white [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-orange-300 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[12px] [&amp;_code]:bg-black/40 [&amp;_code]:border [&amp;_code]:border-white/[0.06] [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:px-1.5 [&amp;_code]:py-0.5">Do not resend an uncertain or consumed action. Use the workflow’s read-only history or recovery guidance to inspect the original request. An approval, dispatch acknowledgment or saved plan does not prove a successful deployment, application health or verified rollback.</div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] p-4 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-0.5">Still blocked?</p><p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Include the failed step and error. Never send a password, token, or cloud secret.</p></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-white/[0.1] text-zinc-300 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-white/5 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors" href="/contact">Open support request<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-3.5 w-3.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div></div><footer class="site-footer border-t border-white/[0.07] bg-[#090a08] px-5 pb-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px]"><section class="flex flex-col gap-8 border-b border-white/[0.07] py-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between lg:py-16" aria-labelledby="footer-cta-heading"><div><p class="text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-zinc-400">Axiom Agent</p><h2 id="footer-cta-heading" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.045em] text-zinc-100 sm:text-5xl">Engineering intent, under control.</h2></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 hover:bg-white" href="/product">Explore Axiom</a><a class="rounded-lg border border-orange-300/30 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-orange-200 transition hover:border-orange-300/60 hover:bg-orange-300/[0.06]" href="/support">Founding Supporters</a></div></section><div class="grid gap-12 py-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_repeat(3,1fr)] lg:gap-10"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100" href="/"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fvision-xix-logo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/>Vision XIX Labs</a><p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">Axiom Agent brings AI assistance, human authorization, execution, and evidence into one governed engineering workflow.</p><p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">We also build iOS applications.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-xs text-zinc-400">Product</h3><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/product">Product</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-color